{"format":"local-vault-ai-portable-chunks-v1","version":1,"chunks":[{"id":"6 - Full Notes/Associative Property.md::0","sourceKey":"6 - Full Notes/Associative Property.md","sourceType":"markdown","sectionKey":"__none__","sourceSearchName":"associative property associative property","filePath":"6 - Full Notes/Associative Property.md","fileName":"Associative Property.md","folder":"6 - Full Notes","title":"Associative Property","heading":"Document","sectionNumber":"","sectionTitle":"","content":"2026-09-05 23:41\n\nStatus: #baby\n\nTags: [[Number Systems and Arithmetic]]","tags":["baby"],"links":["Number Systems and Arithmetic","Commutative Property","algebraessentials.pdf"],"properties":[],"pageStart":0,"pageEnd":0,"embeddingF32":""},{"id":"6 - Full Notes/Associative Property.md::1","sourceKey":"6 - Full Notes/Associative Property.md","sourceType":"markdown","sectionKey":"__none__","sourceSearchName":"associative property associative property","filePath":"6 - Full Notes/Associative Property.md","fileName":"Associative Property.md","folder":"6 - Full Notes","title":"Associative Property","heading":"Associative Property","sectionNumber":"","sectionTitle":"","content":"The associative property says that regrouping repeated addition or multiplication does not change the result:\n\n$$a+(b+c)=(a+b)+c,$$\n\n$$a(bc)=(ab)c.$$\n\nIt justifies suppressing parentheses when an expression contains only a sequence of additions or only a sequence of multiplications. Associativity does not authorize arbitrary regrouping across different operations, and subtraction or division are not associative in general. The property concerns parentheses; changing order instead uses the [[Commutative Property]].","tags":["baby"],"links":["Number Systems and Arithmetic","Commutative Property","algebraessentials.pdf"],"properties":[],"pageStart":0,"pageEnd":0,"embeddingF32":""},{"id":"6 - Full Notes/Associative Property.md::2","sourceKey":"6 - Full Notes/Associative Property.md","sourceType":"markdown","sectionKey":"__none__","sourceSearchName":"associative property associative property","filePath":"6 - Full Notes/Associative Property.md","fileName":"Associative Property.md","folder":"6 - Full Notes","title":"Associative Property","heading":"References","sectionNumber":"","sectionTitle":"","content":"[[algebraessentials.pdf]]","tags":["baby"],"links":["Number Systems and Arithmetic","Commutative Property","algebraessentials.pdf"],"properties":[],"pageStart":0,"pageEnd":0,"embeddingF32":""}]}